- **API Gateway**: Kong / AWS API Gateway / Envoy / custom — recommendation with features needed (rate limiting, auth, request transformation, observability)
- **gRPC vs REST**: Decision per service pair. gRPC for internal high-throughput service-to-service. REST for external/mobile APIs. Justify.
